WEBVTT

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.490
Are you okay?

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:19.240
Y-Yes!

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:22.410
Onii-sama!

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:27.920
Onii-sama!

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:30.840
Onii-sama.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:32.800
Onii-sama.

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:37.180
Onii-sama.

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:38.300
Onii-sama.

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:40.320
It's morning already.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:42.520
I'll go with you to school.

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:27.500
Go ahead, eat up.

00:02:27.930 --> 00:02:29.120
Sorry...

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:31.600
...for getting you to make me breakfast.

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:34.000
You must be tired from the party yesterday.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.960
Well, a lot of things did happen.

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:38.990
But...

00:02:38.990 --> 00:02:41.890
Doing this feels like we're newly-weds.

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:46.390
Onii-sama, are you okay?

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.430
Newly-weds?

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:49.390
What are you saying?

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:53.610
Onii-sama.

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:55.230
Would you like dinner?

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:56.940
A bath?

00:02:57.490 --> 00:03:01.030
Or me?

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:04.510
Onii-sama...

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:05.910
Onii-sama?

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:06.870
Onii-sama?

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:09.620
What's wrong?

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:10.970
Oh, nothing.

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:12.330
Goodness.

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:14.000
It was just a little joke.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:15.840
Joke...

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:21.180
So then, it was a joke back then too?

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:22.340
Back then?

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:24.940
You know, on the day of Father's funeral service.

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:26.180
From outside the window.

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:30.000
I'm your little sister.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.430
You won't be alone anymore.

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:34.190
From now on, we'll be together.

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:39.190
I came to marry you!

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:42.150
Um... I...

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:43.950
...wasn't there...

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:46.130
But I'm certain, back then...

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:47.850
She said she was my little sister.

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:50.850
Wasn't that just a prank?

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:55.580
Anybody would be able to say "I'm your little sister".

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:57.210
Yeah, but...

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.380
A prank, huh?

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:09.520
Yabe.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:10.410
Here!

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:11.180
Yoshioka.

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:12.530
Here.

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:13.370
Wakui.

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:14.690
Here.

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.610
So the only one absent is Kannagi, huh?

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:22.360
Kotori-sensei, why is Kannagi absent?

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:23.750
Hmm, let's see...

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:25.880
She said she caught a cold.

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:27.810
Sensei!

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:28.990
What is it, Tanaka?

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:30.870
If Sensei had a cold, I would want to catch-

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:34.940
You damn idiot!

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.580
You look tiered, Ikusu.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:46.640
I haven't been getting much sleep lately because I've been so busy.

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:49.810
It seems you've been investigating various things,

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:51.350
but have you found anything?

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:54.300
No, I still haven't found anything concrete.

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:55.140
I see...

00:04:56.020 --> 00:05:02.150
All I can say is that the reach of those scheming about your company presidency is definitely extending.

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:05.500
You should be very careful.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:06.410
Understood.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:11.410
Are you okay?

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:13.260
You really look like you aren't getting enough sleep.

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:17.510
It seems like I've reached my limit...

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:18.790
H-Hey!

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:21.210
So, what do you want to do after this?

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.550
I'm sorry!

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:28.390
I didn't see anything!

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:30.890
We didn't see anything!

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.560
N-No!

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.840
It's not like that!

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:36.540
Did you see it?

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:37.830
Did you see it?

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:40.190
It's so embarrassing!

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:41.800
Oh my gosh!

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.160
Now that I think about it, this is where...

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:07.840
Hey, Konoe.

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.410
Ah, Yes?

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:12.050
Would you recommend Marie Chocolate's pudding as well?

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:16.450
Well, my number one recommendation is the cream puff,

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:19.810
but I thought something like this might be better because of the cold.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.390
Miyabi's room is on the third floor, right?

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:29.070
Yes, one floor above mine.

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:35.740
Coming.

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:38.370
Shougo, why are you...?

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.710
Well, because I heard you caught a cold.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:41.580
Thank-

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:45.740
We brought a get-well gift.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:53.280
Your cold doesn't seem to be too bad.

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:55.720
Yeah. It just made me feel a little sluggish.

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.260
Really?

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:58.410
I'm relieved.

00:06:58.410 --> 00:06:59.830
Um... here.

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:01.410
T-Thank you.

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:03.300
I'll make some tea, so let's eat it together.

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:08.240
I'll prepare the tea, so you just rest, Kannagi-san.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:09.740
Y-Yeah.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:50.860
Hey, uh...

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.660
Um... where are the tea leaves?

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.910
Oh, just a moment.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.500
I can't make three cups with just one teabag...

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.540
All right, I'll get some from my room.

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:08.920
Eh, but...

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.590
It's okay, it's close.

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.840
Shougo-san, I'm going out for a bit.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:14.600
Thanks, Konoe.

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:15.220
I'll leave it to you.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:18.140
Well then, I'll be back soon.

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.740
Konoe is taking a while.

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:51.260
Hey, Shougo.

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:52.800
What?

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:00.010
Kiss me.

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:01.440
Huh?

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:03.230
W-What are you saying?

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:06.730
Why?

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:08.900
Why won't you do it with me?

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:11.980
Why...?

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:19.880
If you won't kiss me, then I won't go to school tomorrow, either.

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:21.290
Hey!

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:30.000
If you can't kiss me...

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:33.260
If you can't kiss me, then go on a date.

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:34.720
Huh?

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:36.520
That's fine, right?

00:09:36.520 --> 00:09:37.470
It's a promise.

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:39.940
A promise... What are you deciding by yourself...

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:43.640
You definitely have to, this Sunday.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:45.140
I'm sorry.

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:50.410
Because I was in a hurry, I knocked
over the sugar and had to clean it up.

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:50.980
Hm?

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:13.300
Oh!

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.090
Thanks.

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:18.050
You didn't just make me breakfast, but dinner as well.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.300
It's a simple matter.

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:24.390
Delicious!

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:28.770
Delicious!

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:31.270
This is pretty good, too.

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:35.610
Um... Onii-sama.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:36.820
Hm?

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:38.990
About what you said this morning...

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:43.370
The person at Kumagorou Otou-sama's funeral service claiming to be your little sister...

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.750
What about it?

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:50.750
The truth is, I was attending the funeral service,

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:53.590
but I just remembered that Tsuruma-san also came.

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:57.010
Konoe came to my father's funeral service?

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:58.420
Yes.

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:01.190
When I first laid eyes on Tsuruma-san,

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:04.070
I had the feeling I had seen her before somewhere.

00:11:04.070 --> 00:11:06.540
I didn't remember it right away,

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:08.980
but when you were asking me about it this morning,

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:12.400
I thought back to that day, and realised it.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:13.860
Wait a second.

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:16.940
That overlaps with the day Konoe took the entrance exam for Miryuuin Academy.

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:18.570
She couldn't have gone to the funeral service.

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:20.570
But, I saw her!

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:22.820
Then you're saying Konoe lied?

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:26.660
I'm not saying that, but...

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:30.130
Moreover, why would Konoe do something like that?

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:32.080
I don't know that.

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:33.760
But, Onii-sama...

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:36.820
She must have deceived you in one way or another...

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:38.090
Please be careful.

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:44.330
If there is a person who really needs you for a feeling of support,

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:46.250
please be sure to see through them.

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:49.100
A person who needs my support...

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:52.510
Please stay with me forever!

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:53.940
Don't go anywhere else!

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:55.800
No!

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:57.810
I don't want you to leave me!

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:17.590
Maybe it was Konoe back then...

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:20.210
I'm your little sister.

00:12:20.680 --> 00:12:23.160
You won't be alone anymore.

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:25.220
From now on, we'll be together.

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:28.970
I came to marry you!

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.680
But Konoe was...

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:34.010
Eh?

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:36.440
The day of Kumagorou's funeral service?

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:39.960
I couldn't attend the funeral.

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:44.530
That was the day of Miryuuin Academy's entrance exam.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:51.040
If... If that was Konoe, what was her aim?

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:57.580
All I can say is that the reach of those scheming about your company presidency is definitely extending.

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:02.510
She must have deceived you in one way or another...

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.050
Please be careful.

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:09.470
It can't be...

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:15.440
Aoyama.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:16.310
Here.

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:17.440
Izuka.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:17.980
Here.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:23.490
I thought about a lot of things, so I couldn't sleep at all last night.

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:24.240
Kannagi.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:24.610
Here!

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:26.360
What a good response!

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:27.860
Are you feeling better now?

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:30.830
I got better because I ate get-well pudding.

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:44.130
Eh, interview me?

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:45.170
That's right.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:48.280
Kannagi Miyabi, who distinguished herself in swimming ever since junior high,

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:52.440
and is receiving a scholarship to our academy for it.

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:54.560
With the prefectural tournament preliminaries coming soon,

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:59.560
my information about you, the new age of Aquarius' mermaid princess will do...

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:02.400
...or so my second personality informs me.

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.780
Ah... Oh?

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:10.990
So if you could, I'd like to take pictures of you poolside in a swimsuit.

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:11.600
Eh?

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:13.600
Gravure pictures, too?

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:14.830
I'm flattered.

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.400
No, not exactly gravure.

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:19.330
Just some normal photos.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:21.310
I have club activities after this,

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:24.340
so if you talk to the club president and get permission, then...

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:26.380
Since we used the power of the crystal ball,

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:28.930
that has already been taken care of.

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:31.140
Since I will have permission, you can relax.

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:35.010
As expected of President Araya...

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:36.560
Well, I'll be going home then.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:38.590
Ah, wait a second!

00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:39.350
Here.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:41.020
H-Hey.

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:43.820
What is it?

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:44.650
The promise.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:48.320
You better not break yesterday's promise.

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:51.530
You have to go on a date on Sunday.

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:55.370
Well, I'm going to go and do the interview now.

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:57.370
Y-Yeah...

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:06.210
Miyabi sure was in a great mood.

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:09.010
If she's like that, she must be better.

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:10.880
Is that right?

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:16.390
To me, it seemed as if Kannagi-san was forcing herself.

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:17.990
Ah, I'm sorry.

00:15:17.990 --> 00:15:19.520
I said something strange.

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:25.520
It must be because her tension is up from the prefectural swimming tournament.

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:29.400
So she's feeling a little nervous... Hm?

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:32.950
Um... Shougo-san?

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:36.700
Swimming...

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:48.130
If... If that's how it was...

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:51.050
Ah, Shougo-san!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:53.980
Shougo-san...

00:15:58.060 --> 00:15:59.250
Wow!

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:01.690
This looks delicious!

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:03.060
This is good too!

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.270
But, but...

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:06.190
This might be stale...

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:07.070
Oh!

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:08.690
This looks delicious, too.

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:11.530
But this might be better...

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:12.810
But, but...

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:13.630
Ah!

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:14.990
I can't decide!

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:17.660
President Tendou, could you please cut it out already?!

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:21.000
The student council computers are not for looking at sweets!

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:21.830
Eh...

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:24.250
Isn't it okay if I look a little?

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.250
It's not okay!

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:29.130
Then let me eat the sweets from the student council's cupboard.

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.490
That's for visitors!

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:32.830
How did it get like that?

00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:34.180
That's strange, isn't it?

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:35.510
In the first place, a president-

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:37.300
Excuse me.

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:39.810
W-What is it, Mikadono-senpai?

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:41.480
You didn't even knock, you suddenly-

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:43.600
Kunitachi-san.

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:46.440
W-What is it?

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:48.820
There's something I want to ask you.

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:58.330
Sorry for being late.

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:12.460
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:13.540
You're late.

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:15.720
You were supposed to be here a while ago-

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:21.100
What's the matter?

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:24.140
Ah, perhaps I'm mesmerising you?

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:26.180
Don't say stupid stuff.

00:17:26.180 --> 00:17:27.730
There's no way that would be true, right?

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:31.900
Well, let's go.

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.860
Hey, wait!

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.210
What?

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:39.490
It's meant to be a date, so can you act like it's one?

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.410
Look, let's go.

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:39.860
Hey, why are we at a pool, even when we're on a date?

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:41.530
It can't be helped, right?

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:44.070
The preliminary match of the prefectural tournament is getting close.

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:46.370
If I don't practise...

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:48.580
That might be true, but...

00:19:48.970 --> 00:19:51.750
It's not like you have to swim.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:59.550
It's fine for you to just watch me swim.

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:49.350
Phew, I sure swam a lot.

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:50.390
You really did.

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:54.790
Now that you're satisfied, it's about time to go home.

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:56.100
No way.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:59.980
There's still one more place that we have to go to.

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:06.110
That one more place we have to go is... here?

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:08.450
Don't just stand around.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:09.580
Come on.

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:26.070
The love that ran away is searching for Eden

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:37.660
Despite losing my bearings, I understood the weight I felt from you

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:43.290
We felt it on that summer day

00:22:43.290 --> 00:22:49.380
Do you regret our meeting because of these painful lies?

00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:55.390
Are you saying it was only painful?

00:22:55.390 --> 00:23:03.020
Sweep away the coming tomorrow with those gentle hands

00:23:03.020 --> 00:23:09.110
A promise forever from bygone days

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:15.870
We will certainly be together, because I still believe in you

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:21.880
My pounding heart won't stop now

00:23:21.880 --> 00:23:27.960
It has finally begun, that lovely thing

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:39.680
To a dazzling world of bewilderment with my heavenly lover

00:23:41.640 --> 00:23:44.440
Good, good. Excellent!

00:23:44.440 --> 00:23:46.150
Why don't you try spreading your legs a little wider?

00:23:46.150 --> 00:23:48.120
What are you doing by the poolside?

00:23:48.120 --> 00:23:49.070
Photographing.

00:23:49.070 --> 00:23:50.710
For an interview in the school newspaper.

00:23:50.710 --> 00:23:53.020
Now, why don't you try taking something off?

00:23:53.020 --> 00:23:54.330
Just the top is good.

00:23:54.330 --> 00:23:57.520
Hey, Araya, since you're the club president, I'll give you a warnin-

00:23:57.520 --> 00:23:58.850
What are you doing?

00:23:58.850 --> 00:24:02.030
I'm looking into the future with my crystal ball.

00:24:02.030 --> 00:24:03.030
I can see it!

00:24:03.030 --> 00:24:06.390
Next episode is Episode 12: The Little Sister Has Always Been With You

00:24:06.390 --> 00:24:07.440
They're no good.

00:24:07.440 --> 00:24:09.530
I have to hurry up and do something!
